        "guard:b3->n_i13",
        "guard:b3->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is still not satisfactory"
      ],
      "justification": "The second check on schedule satisfaction, including the gateway, conditions, and converge elements."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "writing a ticket order to SNCF"
      ],
      "justification": "Action taken when the schedule is satisfactory."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
